---
description: Redux-only data fetching — never axios/fetch in components
globs: client/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# Redux data fetching (mandatory)

**ALL** network data fetching happens in `client/store/slices/` via `createAsyncThunk` + **axios**.

Components **only**:
- `useAppDispatch` / `useAppSelector` from `client/store/hooks.ts`
- Dispatch actions and render state

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT
useEffect(() => { void dispatch(fetchData()); }, [dispatch]);
const { data, loading } = useAppSelector((s) => s.mySlice);

// ❌ NEVER — axios/fetch inside a component
useEffect(() => { axios.get("/api/...").then(...); }, []);
```

- Shared/cross-component data → Redux, not local `useState`
- Path aliases: `@/*` → `client/`, `@shared/*` → `shared/`
- Forms: Formik + Yup; submit via dispatched thunks
